Plan: Read the current requirements.txt, query PyPI for each package’s latest stable version, update the file with any newer versions, and for each upgraded package fetch its changelog (or release notes) to extract any “breaking change” entries. Write a concise summary of these breaking changes to UPGRADE.md. All network calls will be done via curl and the logic implemented in a short Python helper script.

